:Class github
⍝ Konducata trigger type for GitHub webhook events.
⍝ No polling — release events arrive via the Jarvis /github_webhook endpoint.
    :field public ns

    ∇ Init arg;config
      :Implements constructor
      :Access public
      config←arg
      ns←⎕NS''
      ns.config←⎕JSON ⎕JSON config
    ∇

    ∇ R←Run nul
      :Access public
      R←⍬  ⍝ No polling needed — events are pushed via webhook
    ∇

:EndClass
